      "content": "\"For too long, we've mortgaged our strength to appease foreign squabbles and embrace treaties that dilute our sovereignty. These alliances are shackles, tying American destiny to the shifting tides of global politics. We must reclaim our absolute autonomy, stand entirely on our own soil, and let the world see the true, untamed power of this nation. Only through absolute self-reliance can the United States truly secure its future.\"",
